// Debug arena for the cave's tests and pictures. Maps named drgarena* get, instead of a generated
// cave, a terrain arena: a flat floor at height 0, terrain walls 1024 units out from the middle and
// a terrain ceiling at 768, so it looks and digs like the cave; nothing is moved or added at
// random (tests place what they need: terrain_spawnenemy <kind> x y z [yaw]). The brushes below
// only seal the map, outside the terrain arena where they are never seen. The player starts at the
// west end looking east down the arena.
// Build: qbsp drgarena.map and light drgarena.bsp (ericw-tools), then put drgarena.bsp in
// <game>/maps.
